@ Thunder Yellow Hoenn sea-sky chapter v1
SootopolisCity_Text_TY_WallaceBefore::
	.string "WALLACE: I study how our sea\n"
	.string "and sky legends keep balance.\p"
	.string "STEVEN is investigating TEAM\n"
	.string "AQUA's activity near ROUTE 128.\p"
	.string "Help him at MOSSDEEP, then\n"
	.string "explore SEAFLOOR CAVERN.$"

SootopolisCity_Text_TY_WallaceStorm::
	.string "WALLACE: KYOGRE's storm is\n"
	.string "spreading beyond HOENN.\p"
	.string "The legend of RAYQUAZA speaks\n"
	.string "of restoring the sea and sky.\p"
	.string "SKY PILLAR rises near ROUTE 131.\n"
	.string "Awaken RAYQUAZA at its summit.\p"
	.string "Use the cleared upper stairs.\n"
	.string "Loose stones were removed.$"

SootopolisCity_Text_TY_WallaceCalm::
	.string "WALLACE: The storm has ended!\n"
	.string "RAYQUAZA restored the balance.\p"
	.string "JUAN can resume your GYM test.\n"
	.string "Thank you for protecting our sea.$"

SootopolisCity_Text_TY_WallaceLegacy::
	.string "WALLACE: You already earned\n"
	.string "JUAN's RAIN BADGE.\p"
	.string "Your earlier journey stands.\n"
	.string "The GYM remains open to you.$"

@ Thunder Yellow Waterfall league bridge v1
SootopolisCity_Text_TY_WaterfallFirst::
	.string "WALLACE: Take this HM for\n"
	.string "WATERFALL. The sea is calm again.\p"
	.string "JUAN's RAIN BADGE will let you\n"
	.string "climb HOENN's waterfalls.$"

SootopolisCity_Text_TY_WaterfallAlternate::
	.string "WALLACE: You already received\n"
	.string "WATERFALL on your earlier journey.\p"
	.string "One HM works in every region.\n"
	.string "Take TM26, EARTHQUAKE, instead.$"

SootopolisCity_Text_TY_WaterfallDirections::
	.string "After earning the RAIN BADGE,\n"
	.string "sail east from ROUTE 128.\p"
	.string "Climb EVER GRANDE's waterfall\n"
	.string "and cross VICTORY ROAD.\p"
	.string "The LEAGUE will check all eight\n"
	.string "of your HOENN BADGES.$"

SootopolisCity_Text_TY_WaterfallFull::
	.string "Your TM CASE has no room.\n"
	.string "Make space, then come back.$"
